+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+No transport compression codec decision is currently recorded for this project. The project's recorded decisions cover related but distinct areas of the transport stack — the wire format (msgpack) and TLS implementation (rustls) — but none of them specify a compression codec, so no codec should be assumed or implemented until a decision is explicitly recorded.
